As Egypt comes together to support its national team on the world stage, talabat Egypt has partnered with V7 “ارفع العلم” (Raise the Flag) initiative to celebrate the pride and spirit that unite us all.

Across cities and neighborhoods, riders are raising the Egyptian flag on their daily journeys, turning everyday orders into a simple show of support for the national team. The initiative reflects the shared excitement, hope, and sense of national pride felt by Egyptians as they cheer on their country.
@v7egypt @talabat_egypt

@talabat_egypt partners with @v7egypt for the “ارفع العلم” initiative, bringing the spirit of national unity to the streets of Egypt. Across the country, riders are proudly carrying the Egyptian flag on their bikes, turning daily orders into a shared moment of support for the Egyptian national team.

From busy city avenues to local neighborhoods, they embody the passion, energy, and optimism of millions of fans standing behind their country on the world stage.

The riders are not just delivering orders; they are carrying the shared pride and hopes of a nation. As World Cup excitement builds, this initiative celebrates the spirit of unity and showcases the unwavering support of Egyptians for their national team.

